{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/efc7f4a0f04c1477b70568f38744c667.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/efc7f4a0f04c1477b70568f38744c667.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/efc7f4a0f04c1477b70568f38744c667.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spend your days caring for gentle lifeforms and collecting glowing pearls in a quiet polar world. <br>But beneath that peaceful surface lies a secret \u2014 a desperate deal to prevent the end of Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/b1ebda5dac17603d2d6d939641222407.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/b1ebda5dac17603d2d6d939641222407.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/b1ebda5dac17603d2d6d939641222407.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Create Your Own World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a single, tiny pearl, life begins to grow. <br>Over time, these creatures will produce special resources \u2014 not just materials, but <strong>the last hope to save Earth</strong>. <br>Nurture your creatures, help them evolve, and build a world that belongs only to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/8c75a8349d628e38382b7f733500136b.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/8c75a8349d628e38382b7f733500136b.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/8c75a8349d628e38382b7f733500136b.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddec Continue the Cycle of Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed different characters to create entirely new lifeforms. <br>Each generation has its own look, movement, and value. <br>Keep evolving \u2014 fill your sea with rarer, cuter, and more precious creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/cf1e5b87930ed43df9ba36dd26fb8832.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/cf1e5b87930ed43df9ba36dd26fb8832.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/cf1e5b87930ed43df9ba36dd26fb8832.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf19 Raise by Day, Trade by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, gather resources and raise your creatures. <br>At night, sell your goods at the alien night market \u2014 but beware, the aliens are cold and calculating. <br>They offer only one condition:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFail to reach your gold quota, and we\u2019ll destroy Earth.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the calm world turns tense with negotiation and survival. <br>Trade with the aliens to endure another day, and prepare for the next sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/29d1a3b04e92b6c1006ef58fed8b578d.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/29d1a3b04e92b6c1006ef58fed8b578d.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/29d1a3b04e92b6c1006ef58fed8b578d.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Gather Gold and Save Earth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day ends with a profit report and a new decision to make. <br>Upgrade your facilities, enhance your drones, and reach your goal within <strong>28 days</strong>. <br>As time runs out, the world grows quieter \u2014 and the fate of Earth lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/b39a61c6e4f5ce6d4be58b0b10d3cc26.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/b39a61c6e4f5ce6d4be58b0b10d3cc26.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/b39a61c6e4f5ce6d4be58b0b10d3cc26.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 Automated Drone System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones silently roam the frozen seas of Polaria, collecting waste, resources, and the precious pearls your creatures produce. <br>Even when you step away, they keep working \u2014 faithfully sustaining life in this fading world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036470?t=1760810064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036470?t=1760810064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/e94440b4835f3408c140db929ac3c66cbb36547b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760810064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/e94440b4835f3408c140db929ac3c66cbb36547b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760810064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/efc7f4a0f04c1477b70568f38744c667.poster.avif?t=1760810064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/efc7f4a0f04c1477b70568f38744c667.webm?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036470/extras/efc7f4a0f04c1477b70568f38744c667.mp4?t=1760810064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid